83528298412888", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982620_7383528311746220_2178009886707352184_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fBa4SBe9Jk4Q7kNvwFeqemk&_nc_oc=Adp9O6SKORVQgt5OEqZKRzkTAxdwJgyLlzDTCjNKJ7uFolACcqvB8MH6AQifyQ6hTKg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2T-lMUVSbqaj7rCvlOZIABHpzcHjZMLR0wQvWlkNQEYA&oe=69F1EBDB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TaskTitan_2560x1440.png", "id": "318678027752199", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982572_318678031085532_2872445775829117351_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BaasI2O4gsAQ7kNvwGRWjYF&_nc_oc=AdqoM9FNcPNqFUjufUdiSlda3jD22ICBJXcdcpmU7dMHCyn0iQV9pqm2S7oHQB-0Kyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0-y7WUuHIJKCYoqSl6VzIw-r3l_o2WtbArsc-ojgHI5A&oe=69F210B0"}, "display_name": "Task Titans", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Task Titans is a series of 3 virtual reality mini games intended to teach the player project management concepts. \n\nDefeat Gremlins:\nOvercome risks and issues by battling gremlins, enhancing your problem-solving skills.\n\nBridge Building: \nConstruct one of multiples bridges types,  applying project management principles to ensure success.\n\nResource Management & Team Coordination:\nManage resources wisely and work with a team to bring your bridge project to completion.\n\nLearn Valuable Life Skills:\nGain insights into leadership, teamwork, strategic planning, and adaptability through real-life project scenarios.\n \nExperience:\nWhether a beginner or a seasoned pro, \"The Task Titans\" offers a fun and educational way to sharpen your project management skills.", "short_description": "Jump into the role of a project manager in \"The Task Titans,\" where you'll tackle various challenges from saving spaceships to constructing bridges and solving treasure maps."}]}, "developer_name": "START", "developer_privacy_policy_